him to Earth. Guy's father, Leo, then used Galeon's technology to rebuild his shattered son as a cyborg, in the hopes that he could stop the aliens when they appear. Now, with Galeon as its core, GaoGaiGar fights to protect Earth. He is aided by a team of transforming robots and by a young boy named Mamoru, who has the power to purify the Zonders' cores, and seems to be connected to the mysterious Galeon.\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"},"tags":[{"name":"Super Robot","rank":97,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Robots","rank":91,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Cyborg","rank":86,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Artificial Intelligence","rank":86,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Aliens","rank":82,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Trains","rank":76,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Urban","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Family Life","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Space","rank":60,"spoiler":true},{"name":"School","rank":52,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Kuudere","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"CGI","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tragedy","rank":20,"spoiler":true}],"titles":{"display":"The King of Braves: GaoGaiGar","english":"The King of Braves: GaoGaiGar","native":"勇者王ガオガイガー","romaji":"Yuusha-Ou GaoGaiGar","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"勇者王GaoGaiGar"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}